      "content": "thanks. actually, we've been running some preliminary tests and we're finding these weird, intermittent glitches where certain buttons just don't respond or labels aren't being read correctly, but then they work fine a minute later. it's like they're hiding or something. how should i document these kinds of unpredictable edge cases in my audit report?",
