      "content": "that makes sense. i'll make sure to include the logs and timestamps. it's just frustrating because it feels so random, like the bugs are intentionally avoiding our testing tools. do you think there's a way to categorize these \"ghost\" bugs specifically? i want to distinguish them from the standard, predictable errors we've already logged.",
